4:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-gray mt-8 max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-gray-900 prose-p:leading-7 prose-p:text-gray-600 prose-li:text-gray-600","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Fleet tracking is more than just seeing vehicles on a map. The best systems help owners understand movement, reduce idle time, monitor route efficiency, and react faster to issues.</p><p>Businesses that use reporting and alerts well usually get the biggest return from their tracking platform.</p><h2>Useful features</h2><ul><li>Live location monitoring</li><li>Trip history</li><li>Geofence alerts</li><li>Driver behavior insights</li><li>Maintenance reminders</li></ul>"}}]}]
